; Fixed trampoline in the audited $FA6A-$FA7F seam.  The generated loop's
; three-byte absolute JMP cannot reach bank $97 directly, so keep the original
; backedge size and cross banks here.  tools/build_interp_rom.py byte-pins both
; this island and the generated JMP target.  Keep this section last: Poppy's
; last writer wins when backward .org regions overlap.
.org $FA6A
h1e7c0_generated_reentry:
    jml.l h1e7c0_hot_reentry
h1e7c0_generated_reentry_end:
